  "title": "Scholarships for Nepali Students to Study in India",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "scholarships-for-nepali-students-to-study-in-india"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-05-01T04:50:38",
  "excerpt": "The connection between India and Nepal extends beyond geography and culture—it is deeply rooted in mutual cooperation and development. Among [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "45a416ab7607",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bf137919c1f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The connection between India and Nepal extends beyond geography and culture—it is deeply rooted in mutual cooperation and development. Among the many areas of collaboration, one of the most impactful has been education. India’s various scholarship programs for Nepali students have played a significant role in fostering capacity building and empowering Nepal’s youth for decades."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "932483d9f631",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aff25c94f90e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Through these scholarships, thousands of students—from middle school to doctoral levels—have received financial support to pursue quality education in a wide array of disciplines such as engineering, medicine, agriculture, business, computer science, music, and fine arts. These efforts are a reflection of India’s “Neighbourhood First” policy, reinforcing strong bilateral ties through education and opportunity."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e2ad677117e5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "be5137596d74",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A Legacy of Support"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b0dee6af1983",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "49fbfb245136",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Each year, the Government of India offers around 1,500 scholarships to Nepali nationals, benefitting students studying both in India and within Nepal. Since 2006, more than "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e1a2f0a62e8d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "27,000 Nepali students"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d3ceefc03b4d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " have been supported through these programs, a clear testament to the impact of these initiatives."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f13412cc9d20",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3e37228b4b8c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "These scholarships are not just about covering tuition; they are about enabling dreams—whether that means pursuing traditional medicine in India, obtaining a professional degree, or continuing studies within Nepal. With options spanning undergraduate, postgraduate, and Ph.D. levels, these programs offer diverse pathways for academic and professional growth."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a82dd0109741",
      "_type": "block",
