      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "021608ff6cca",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For many students in Nepal, these scholarship opportunities represent more than financial assistance—they’re a gateway to life-changing education, global exposure, and long-term career development. Studying in India’s premier institutions also allows students to engage with diverse cultures and academic environments that are closely tied to Nepal’s own history and traditions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bca287e36ec6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5a8b374aeb9b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The accessibility and variety of these programs ensure that students from all backgrounds can find a suitable pathway to continue their studies. Whether you aim to become a doctor, engineer, artist, or researcher, there is a scholarship to help you get started."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
